<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. WOMEN'S HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. WOMEN'S HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000 U.S.</p>
<p>Women's Hardcourt Championships on Monday (Prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat 8-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Sabine Applemans (Belgium) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 4-2 retired</p>
</text>
